---
/*
	German route.

	It renders the English page component rather than duplicating it: the two are
	the same component tree, and every string inside already comes from the
	dictionary keyed by Astro.currentLocale — which Astro derives from this file
	sitting under /de/. So the same tree renders in German here and in English at
	the unprefixed path, from one source.

	A copied page is a page that drifts, and the copy is always the one nobody
	remembers to update. Anything that should differ between locales belongs in
	~/i18n/ui, not here.
*/
import Page from '../customers.astro';
---

<Page />
